<title>UK: TABLE - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending Aug 22 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>MONDAY, Aug 18</p>
<p> Argos Plc	    H   PFT	    27.8	25.5-31.0     31.8</p>
<p>				DIV	     6.0	 5.5-6.0	 5.3</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, Aug 20</p>
<p> Bodycote Intl Plc  H   PFT	    22.1	21.0-23.5     12.4</p>
<p>				DIV	     3.5	 3.0-3.5	 2.8</p>
<p> Rentokil Plc	 H   PFT	   200.0     196.0-205.0   134.5</p>
<p>						  0.9	0.79-0.9	*0.74</p>
<p> Weir Group Plc     H   PFT	    24.0	22.4-25.5     19.2</p>
<p>				DIV	     2.5	 2.5-2.6	 2.3</p>
<p>THURSDAY, Aug 21</p>
<p> Halifax Plc	  H   PFT	   789.0     755.5-815.0   738.0</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>* Dividend adjusted for 2:1 share split</p>
<p>-- Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
